		(uuid "27e601d0-1a8f-4f05-a957-72ae8cba8b5d")
	)
	(text "MAT_ALLOWED drives every active-low shift-register clear input. Clearing the shift\nregister does not itself transfer cleared data into output storage. Keep outputs\ndisabled, shift the full intended image, latch it, and only then request operation.\nThe circuit includes local 100n bypass capacitors for all ten packages."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 122.205 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "32e6705f-0d00-43f6-b14f-1b265f735e79")
	)
	(text "Ten SN74HC595 registers form one 80-bit chain, from U1400 through U1409.\nMAT_SPI_MOSI enters U1400, and MAT_CHAIN_0-8 connect successive serial\noutputs to the next register. MAT_SPI_SCK shifts the chain; MAT_CONFIG_LATCH\ntransfers the complete image into the output storage registers."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 42.34 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "44df89f8-88ef-4ed0-ab33-a80114d9d714")
	)
	(text "NL CLAMP MASK"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 87.54 135.155 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4bb12b1c-f5be-4b47-95c0-832234af493d")
	)
	(text "Clear and reload sequence"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 116.865 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "54d26c4d-98e4-4c7a-912e-84901a51b276")
	)
	(text "Serial order: U1400 -> U1401 -> U1402 -> U1403 -> U1404 -> U1405 -> U1406 -> U1407 -> U1408 -> U1409.\nSCK shifts the serial register; LATCH copies all 80 bits to output storage. OE high makes outputs high-Z."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.54 207.155 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "58c6668b-43d7-4d07-bc5f-988641f84d8e")
	)
	(text "VMM MASK / 32 BL DAC SWITCHES"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.54 39.445 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "59205b2d-2df0-4b8f-bd60-2649aecdf102")
	)
	(text "The four VMM-mask registers use MAT_VMM_OE_N. The remaining six registers use\nMAT_OE_N. A high enable-control level makes the affected outputs high\nimpedance. Downstream pull resistors then establish the individual\nswitch-control defaults."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 102.239 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "988e0cd7-0c4a-4d00-b5ca-09695104d395")
	)
	(text "Word-line and neuron-line masks"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 76.933 0)
		(effects
